                "description": "Simply designed, the Colonial Lever made by Baldwin is great for traditional homes where an elegant and classic look is desired. It is constructed from solid brass and finished beautifully. It will fit a 1-3/8 inch thick door and it is designed to conceal a 2-1/8 inch pre-drilled door.\r\n",
